# GitHub, not GitLab

This repo uses GitHub issues, pull requests, and GitHub Actions only.

Do not add GitLab CI, GitLab Pages, `.gitlab-ci.yml`, or `glab` workflows.

One finding → one GitHub issue → one branch → one PR against `main`.

Knowledge publish path: GitHub Actions → GitHub Pages (intended hostname `knowledge.cafe.artof.link`, live URL Unknown until probed). Restaurant hostname is `cafe.artof.link` (later; Unknown).
